              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manje funga kimi ngoJehova ukuthi awuyikuqeda inzalo yami emva kwami, nokuthi awuyikuqeda igama lami endlini kababa.",
          "type": "text",
